    "solution": "Stay seated and lean across the first fork to take the high line. Cut the condenser while approaching the end, then jump out, collect the feather and make the second jump onto the far observation gallery. Turn the mirror from the left: it lights the sealed receiver, opens the home exit and also removes the long track you used to get here. Watch the ice thaw and the train fall into the lower vault. Drop on its eastern side and dash it west; the empty train parks at the opposite stop, putting the lower conveyor route in its shadow. Follow underneath the missing outbound bridge, then jump and dash up at the western end of the overhead rail and walk back to the home exit.",
    "nearestExisting": "F18 is the nearest cart/thaw/shadow room, and B29 sends a movable shield ahead. This switchyard adds a piloted high fork, an optical latch that physically removes the outgoing rail, access to the train’s far face after thaw, and an explicit reversal that shades the lower return.",
